@1 = ~Welcome to my brewery, traveler. What can I do for you?~
@2 = ~Larissa of the River District sent me. She needs two special potions: one to cool her husband's appetite for women, and another to restore his affection for her.~
@3 = ~I'd like to try some of your drinks.~
@4 = ~Not today. Farewell.~
@5 = ~Ah, Larissa. A troublesome business, that. I have both mixtures prepared. The two will cost 120 gold pieces altogether. Are you taking them to her?~
@6 = ~Yes. Here are 120 gold pieces. I'll deliver them to Larissa.~
@7 = ~Not yet. I'll come back for them.~
@8 = ~One golden bottle, one dark one. Keep them safe on the way back, and tell Larissa they are exactly what she asked for.~
